---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import data from '../../data/vendors.json';
const vendors = [...data].sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
const description = 'Directory of the AI receptionist vendors we track. Starting prices are sourced. Sponsored spots are labeled.';
const jsonld = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ItemList',
  name: 'AI receptionist vendors',
  itemListElement: vendors.map((v, i) => ({
    '@type': 'ListItem',
    position: i + 1,
    name: v.name,
    url: new URL(`/vendors/${v.slug}/`, Astro.site).href,
  })),
};
---
<Base title="AI receptionist vendors" description={description} jsonld={jsonld}>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>AI receptionist vendors</h1>
      <p class="lead">This is the directory of AI receptionist vendors we track. Starting prices are sourced. Sponsored spots are labeled.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <p>Names are alphabetical. That order is not a ranking. Where the dataset has no starting price, the row says Not verified. Open a vendor for the source and the date we checked it. The same list is the <a href="/data/">open dataset</a>.</p>
    <div class="tablewrap vendor-index" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="vendor-index-caption">
      <table class="compare">
        <caption id="vendor-index-caption">Every vendor we track, A to Z. Sponsored spots are labeled. Not verified means no starting price was sourced.</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Vendor</th>
            <th scope="col">Starting price</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {vendors.map((v) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">
                <a href={`/vendors/${v.slug}/`}>{v.name}</a>
                {v.sponsored && <span class="badge">Sponsored</span>}
              </th>
              <td data-label="Starting price">{v.starting_price || <span class="missing">Not verified</span>}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
